  "hindsight_usage_summary": "Hindsight provides persistent agent memory. Before each diagnostic, the agent calls recall() to retrieve similar past incidents; on a hit with success_rate >= 0.8, it returns the cached playbook in ~1.5s with zero LLM tokens. After each fresh diagnosis, retain() commits the new playbook to the bank. Human feedback (accept/modify/reject) further tunes the success_rate metadata so future recalls rank proven fixes higher."
